                    April 28, 1967. Secret; Eyes Only. Copies were sent to Kohler, Vance, and Helms.
                    Prepared by Jessup on May 1.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d254-f2" n="2" xml:id="d254-f2-content">
                <p>A copy of a CIA memorandum to the 303 Committee, April 14, on the subject “Covert
                    Action Program Against Communist China,” is attached but not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
